.SH Constants
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_FFSRO_SHIFT" 12
FFSRO shift
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_NOFS_SHIFT" 12
NOFS shift
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_FAWR_SHIFT" 12
FAWR shift
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_SMUD_SHIFT" 12
SMUD shift
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_FFSRO_MASK" 12
FFSRO mask
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_NOFS_MASK" 12
NOFS mask
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_FAWR_MASK" 12
FAWR mask
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_SMUD_MASK" 12
SMUD mask
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_FFSRO" 12
If set, the first firmware slot is readonly
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_NOFS" 12
Mask to get the value of the number of
firmware slots that the controller supports.
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_FAWR" 12
If set, the controller supports firmware
activation without a reset.
.IP "NVME_CTRL_FRMW_SMUD" 12
If set, the controller is able to detect
overlapping firmware/boot partition
image update.
